	(text "VBUS = USB input / charger input only\n+BATT = raw battery / charger battery node and MAX17048 sense/supply\nSW_BATT = switched battery output from external power switch\nVSYS = diode/PMOS-selected system / buck input\nFor charge-while-off: battery + to B+/+BATT, switch output to SW+/SW_BATT;\nQ2 populated blocks USB backfeed."
